"c42e57b7-64df-484d-92b0-3576fa3f4a30" data-turn-start-message="true" dir="auto" tabindex="0" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="272">That’s okay — <strong data-start="14" data-end="62">we don’t need to recover it from your phone.</strong> The exact mountain scene is still identifiable from the original HTML you pasted earlier. It’s the Unsplash mountain/lake photo with ID <code data-start="199" data-end="233">photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb</code>. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="235" data-content-reference-end="259"><span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] translate-y-0.5 animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 101px;"><a href="https://www.positioniseverything.net/how-to-link-unsplash-images-in-html-and-css/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.positioniseverything.net/how-to-link-unsplash-images-in-html-and-css/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl pe-2 ps-1 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 101px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="" width="128" height="128" class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full" src="./mountain_files/favicons"></span><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Position Is Everything</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
<p data-start="274" data-end="311"><span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="261" data-content-reference-end="390"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener">Open the exact mountain image<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-f290a825.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></span></p>
<p data-start="313" data-end="333">On your <strong data-start="321" data-end="332">desktop</strong>:</p>
<ol data-start="335" data-end="578">
<li data-section-id="1i30l4j" data-start="335" data-end="354">
<p data-start="338" data-end="354">Click that link.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="n94hyc" data-start="355" data-end="411">
<p data-start="358" data-end="411">Right-click the mountain picture → <strong data-start="393" data-end="411">Save image as…</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="p7rquy" data-start="412" data-end="441">
<p data-start="415" data-end="441">Name it <strong data-start="423" data-end="441"><code data-start="425" data-end="439">mountain.jpg</code></strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6hw4oz" data-start="442" data-end="500">
<p data-start="445" data-end="500">In GitHub, go to the same folder where <code data-start="484" data-end="496">index.html</code> is.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ood0y5" data-start="501" data-end="564">
<p data-start="504" data-end="564">Click <strong data-start="510" data-end="537">Add file → Upload files</strong> and upload <code data-start="549" data-end="563">mountain.jpg</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1shcdwf" data-start="565" data-end="578">
<p data-start="568" data-end="578">Commit it.</p>
</li>
</ol>
